# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-seats8-262k window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/seats8-262k and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final.
# ORDER.txt says the order, each job's stop rule, its minutes and the GO rule. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-1 is the QUAD-FIRST image: built by SB9 from this branch's
# commit WITHOUT the stage-1 evidence (packed_any_evidence_tp4_262144.json and ordered_writer_evidence_tp4.json are PENDING skeletons: the one-card jobs that would
# fill them are DEFERRED). The gate-only 262k profiles carry QWEN_FAST_262K_EVIDENCE_WAIVER=1, which waives both records in a gate run of a gate-only profile and nowhere
# else, logs '262k evidence WAIVED (gate-only)' once, and makes EVERY result of the window UNQUALIFIED (a run, not evidence). No baked default: the eight-seat
# 131k image tp4-serve-8 stays what ships until the owner says otherwise. The node agent is ALREADY stopped (no agentstop, no agentstart, no hand-back in this
# window). Each job names its profile explicitly. A commit that changes a file the image carries needs a new SB9 build and a new tag in every template.
# B9b (STOP, the first 262k attach): the AUDITED 262k eight-seat gate profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-gate (max-model-len 262,144, 21,760 pooled blocks,
# QWEN_FAST_KV_RESERVATION=1, QWEN_DSPARK_REQUEST_CONTEXT 131,072, drafter_headroom_tokens 32). An all-four reset, then: warmup, one coding stream, eight equal
# 4k code prompts (the audited exactness shape), the mixed set, the split-block shape and the drain. READ, in this order, and stop at the first failure:
# (1) '[PINDIAG] packed-any admission passed UNQUALIFIED: ... capacity=262144' after the one '262k evidence WAIVED (gate-only)' line (the records are skeletons), 'kv reservation installed',
#     argv max-model-len 262144, extent block engaged blocks=2, ZERO audit mismatches (T1, T2, extent);
# (2) every 4k answer's hash equal to S8-1's (the same prompts at a 262k window: the window changes no 4k answer);
# AUDITS ON in this job (the profile's env): QWEN_FAST_VERIFY_T1_AUDIT=1, QWEN_FAST_VERIFY_T2_AUDIT=1 (every verify round read back and compared) and
# QWEN_FAST_GDN_PREFILL_CONV_AUDIT=4. QWEN_FAST_EXTENT_AUDIT is a gate-only knob the GATE arms add (a profile never carries it; the smoke step has no arm env), so the
# extent-reader audit is read in L9a, L9b and C9, where an ordered-writer or K64j error past 131k is an [EXTENT-AUDIT] MISMATCH. The admission line reads 'passed UNQUALIFIED ... capacity=262144' after '262k evidence WAIVED (gate-only)'.
# (3) vLLM accepted a 262,144 window (max_position_embeddings is 262,144).
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; attach 15-40 min; the six tests 30-50 min: 70 / 90 / 100 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-gate
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
